# Decisions: Project Index

Purpose:
  Project-specific decision index. Concrete decisions are generated per
  project from templates. This file provides the schema and routing only.

Types:
  architectural: Architecture decisions
  technical: Tech stack choices
  security: Security decisions
  business: Business rule decisions
  operational: Deployment/ops decisions
  human: Human approvals/rejections
  ai: AI proposals/decisions

States:
  proposed: New decisions awaiting review
  review: Under human review
  approved: Accepted and ready for implementation
  rejected: Not accepted
  superseded: Replaced by a later decision

Navigation:
  Index: @INDEX.sdd
  Schema: @../../decisions/schema.sdd
  Template: @../../../templates/_sdd/decisions/DEC-000.template.sdd
  Workflow: @../../decisions/workflow.sdd
  Rules: @../../decisions/rules.sdd
  TaskLifecycle: @../../decisions/task-lifecycle.sdd
  Integration: @../../decisions/integration.sdd

Note:
  This file contains no concrete decisions. Concrete decisions are
   generated per project by the project-structure skill from the template
   at templates/_sdd/decisions/DEC-000.template.sdd.

State: +
